(1) 1971/   871FC :                     	; InitMusicPlayback, and Sound_PlayBGM for that matter,
(1) 1972/   871FC :                     	; don't do a very good job of setting up the music tracks.
(1) 1973/   871FC :                     	; Tracks that aren't defined in a music file's header don't have
(1) 1974/   871FC :                     	; their channels defined, meaning .sendfmnoteoff won't silence
(1) 1975/   871FC :                     	; hardware properly. In combination with removing the below
(1) 1976/   871FC :                     	; calls to FMSilenceAll/PSGSilenceAll, this will cause hanging
(1) 1977/   871FC :                     	; notes.
(1) 1978/   871FC :                     	; To fix this, we'll just forcefully set all channels, here:
(1) 1979/   871FC : 43EE 0001           	lea	SMPS_RAM.v_music_track_ram+SMPS_Track.VoiceControl(a6),a1			; Start at the first music track...
